Here is one example of contradictory behaviour in NetHack: your pet
animal is able to identify which corpses are poisonous, rotted or
dangerous, yet when you polymorph into their form, you don't have this
ability.

So, this patch makes it so that polymorphing into an animal, or being
afflicted with lycanthropy, gives you the food appraisal "intrinsic"
(normally conferred temporarily by blessed food detection) for as long
as you are an animal or lycanthrope.

